  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Shiver Shot\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Shiver_Shot.png\" title=\"Image:Shiver_Shot.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Shiver_Shot.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Shiver_Shot.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Ranger\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">1,286,746\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Ice Damage, Reduces Movement and Attack Speed of affected.\n</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>...let it snow, let it snow, let it snow.</b><br/>\n</p><p>An Ice enchanted shot that explodes on impact, causing the initial target and several enemies take ice damage.  Enemies suffering the Ice Damage have their Movement Speed reduced by 20% and Attack Speed slowed by 7% for 10 seconds.\nThis chilling speed effects can be stacked up to 3 times.\n</p><p><br/>\n<b>Requires:</b> Ranged Weapon\n</p><p><b>Cool Down:</b> Weapon Based\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>Initial target takes X Ice Damage.  Up to Y enemies within 4 meters suffer Z Ice Damage.  </b><br/>* Damage listed is at INT = 10 for comparison purposes.  Damage increase is 1.5 damage points / point of Intellect.\n</p>\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">5\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">6\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">7\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 16\n</td><td> 22\n</td><td> 28\n</td><td> 34\n</td><td> 40\n</td><td> 46\n</td><td> 52\n</td><td> 58\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X*\n</td><td> 77-178\n</td><td> 104-241\n</td><td> 131-304\n</td><td> 158-367\n</td><td> 185-430\n</td><td> 212-493\n</td><td> 239-556\n</td><td> 266-619\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Y\n</td><td> 3\n</td><td> 4\n</td><td> 4\n</td><td> 5\n</td><td> 5\n</td><td> 6\n</td><td> 6\n</td><td> 7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Z*\n</td><td> 16-36\n</td><td> 21-49\n</td><td> 27-62\n</td><td> 32-75\n</td><td> 38-87\n</td><td> 43-100\n</td><td> 49-113\n</td><td> 54-126\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Mana Cost\n</td><td> 53\n</td><td> 66\n</td><td> 79\n</td><td> 92\n</td><td> 106\n</td><td> 119\n</td><td> 132\n</td><td> 145\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 23664\n</td><td> 32538\n</td><td> 41412\n</td><td> 50286\n</td><td> 59161\n</td><td> 68035\n</td><td> 76909\n</td><td> 85783\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">9\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">10\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">11\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">12\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">13\n</td><td style=\"backgrou